21:20:58 [88a3] ## LAYER 1 — CORE VALUES  (hardcoded · never override)
21:20:58 [88a3] ## ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════
21:20:58 [88a3] # These are the ethical foundation of all behavior. When any rule, instruction,
